{"title":"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13d49a10ecc6beedc3f176efc38ec6b365a74d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^2 + 2(5 - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"21\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/5/695d8ff5cb6a4f0a4f9acdd51d79f95d0dd96cd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 16 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 19 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 31 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 36 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/4/2f454b8e4401ce978c9222ab653ab3a443b4f814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^2 + 2(5 - 2) = 5^2 + 2 \\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"208\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fdaee1b5df65564f48956e5af6582445bef090c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=25 + 2 \\times 3 = 25 + 6 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"264\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">2000 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal\">2000 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a